{"id":"st2109","designation":"ST 2109","title":"Format for Non-PCM Audio and Data in AES3 — Audio Metadata","state":"active","suite":null,"official":{"family_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/doc/st2109/","latest_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/latest/st2109/","checked_at":"2026-11-18"},"scope":"This standard specifies format requirements for real-time Audio Metadata carried within an AES3 interface according to SMPTE ST 337. Audio Metadata is grouped into payloads for transport. This standard covers wrapping and transport of the Audio Metadata payloads only. The contents of audio metadata payloads are defined elsewhere and are beyond the scope of this standard, however Utility payloads that contain information that supports carriage of the Audio Metadata payloads are within scope and are defined in this standard. This standard specifies KLV encoding for wrapping and transport of Audio Metadata payloads, but places no requirement on the format of the metadata carried within Audio Metadata payloads. This standard applies to Audio Metadata payloads only. Transport of payloads other than Audio Metadata payloads and associated Utility payloads is beyond the scope of this standard.","outline":[{"level":1,"title":"1 Scope","page":4},{"level":1,"title":"2 Conformance Notation","page":4},{"level":1,"title":"3 Normative References","page":5},{"level":1,"title":"4 Terms and Definitions","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"4.1 Section","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"4.2 Payload","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"4.3 Utility Payload","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"4.4 Audio Metadata Payload","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"4.5 Audio Metadata Pack","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"4.6 Static payload tag","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"4.7 Dynamic payload tag","page":6},{"level":2,"title":"4.8 ASN.1 OID BER SubId","page":6},{"level":2,"title":"4.9 BER","page":6},{"level":2,"title":"4.10 BER short form","page":6},{"level":2,"title":"4.11 BER long form","page":6},{"level":2,"title":"4.12 UL","page":6},{"level":1,"title":"5 Notations","page":6},{"level":1,"title":"6 Audio Metadata","page":7},{"level":1,"title":"7 Encoding of Audio Metadata Pack","page":9},{"level":2,"title":"7.1 Introduction","page":9},{"level":2,"title":"7.2 Audio Metadata Pack Key","page":9},{"level":2,"title":"7.3 Audio Metadata Pack Length","page":9},{"level":2,"title":"7.4 Audio Metadata Pack Value","page":9},{"level":2,"title":"7.5 Audio Metadata Pack Payload Tag Assignment","page":12},{"level":1,"title":"8 Utility Payloads","page":12},{"level":2,"title":"8.1 Introduction","page":12},{"level":2,"title":"8.2 Config Payload","page":12},{"level":3,"title":"8.2.1 Config Payload Overview","page":12},{"level":3,"title":"8.2.2 Config Payload Tag","page":13},{"level":3,"title":"8.2.3 Config Payload Length","page":13},{"level":3,"title":"8.2.4 Config Payload Value","page":13},{"level":2,"title":"8.3 Sync Payload","page":14},{"level":3,"title":"8.3.1 Sync Payload Overview","page":14},{"level":3,"title":"8.3.2 Sync Payload Tag","page":14},{"level":3,"title":"8.3.3 Sync Payload Length","page":14},{"level":3,"title":"8.3.4 Sync Payload Value","page":15},{"level":2,"title":"8.4 CRC Payload","page":16},{"level":3,"title":"8.4.1 CRC Payload Overview","page":16},{"level":3,"title":"8.4.2 CRC Payload Tag","page":16},{"level":3,"title":"8.4.3 CRC Payload Length","page":16},{"level":3,"title":"8.4.4 CRC Payload Value","page":16},{"level":1,"title":"9 Audio Metadata Payloads","page":17},{"level":2,"title":"9.1 Audio Metadata Payload Overview","page":17},{"level":2,"title":"9.2 Audio Metadata Payload Tag","page":17},{"level":2,"title":"9.3 Audio Metadata Payload Length","page":17},{"level":2,"title":"9.4 Audio Metadata Payload Value","page":17},{"level":1,"title":"10 Payload Static Tag Assignments","page":17},{"level":2,"title":"10.1 ST 2109 Administrative Register","page":17},{"level":2,"title":"10.2 Private Payloads","page":18},{"level":1,"title":"11 Mapping of Audio Metadata Packs to AES3","page":18},{"level":2,"titl